  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Positive:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Pathogenic/likely pathogenic NOTCH3 gene variant detected (e.g., c.1234G&gt;A, p.Cys412Tyr), confirming diagnosis of&nbsp;<strong>CADASIL</strong>. Associated with autosomal dominant inheritance; first-degree relatives have a 50% risk.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\">\n<p class=\"my-0\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Negative:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No pathogenic NOTCH3 variant detected in tested regions; CADASIL unlikely, but not fully excluded if clinical suspicion remains.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\">\n<p class=\"my-0\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Variant of Uncertain Significance (VUS):</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">A variation was found but significance is unclear; clinical and familial correlation needed.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
